{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 04 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">视觉 Transformer：全局交互、层级窗口与高分辨率代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision Transformers</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_089_deit-title\">DeiT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">增加 distillation token 和专用 head，使 CNN teacher 信号通过 Transformer attention 注入 ViT。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Augments ViT with a learnable distillation token that interacts with patch tokens via self-attention to distill inductive biases from a CNN teacher.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">ImageNet/医学 2D 图像与训练时 CNN teacher logits</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image (plus CNN teacher hard predictions during training)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">class token 与 distillation token 融合的分类预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Fused class-token and distillation-token classification prediction</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v139/touvron21a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_089_deit')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_089_deit')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DeiT original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/ca9c54f89c407a6cd0ee.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_089_deit\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_089_deit')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_089_deit\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">经强增强与常规 ImageNet 规模监督训练</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image (plus cnn teacher hard predictions during training) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"经强增强与常规 ImageNet 规模监督训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image (plus cnn teacher hard predictions during training) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">经强增强与常规 ImageNet 规模监督训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image (plus cnn teacher hard predictions during training) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"固定大小 image patches 线性投影并加位置编码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Patch tokens to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Patch tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch tokens\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">固定大小 image patches 线性投影并加位置编码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Patch tokens to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两个可学习 token 分别服务真实标签与 teacher 蒸馏\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CLS + Distill within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"CLS + Distill\" data-node-name-en=\"CLS + Distill\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CLS + Distill</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两个可学习 token 分别服务真实标签与 teacher 蒸馏</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CLS + Distill within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多层 MHSA+MLP 共同更新 patch、class 和 distillation tokens\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT Encoder within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"ViT Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多层 MHSA+MLP 共同更新 patch、class 和 distillation tokens</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT Encoder within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练时提供 hard/soft teacher target，不进入部署主干\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CNN Teacher within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"CNN Teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN Teacher\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CNN Teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练时提供 hard/soft teacher target，不进入部署主干</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CNN Teacher within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CLS token 对真实类别标签优化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Class head within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Class head\" data-node-name-en=\"Class head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Class head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CLS token 对真实类别标签优化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Class head within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"distillation token 对 teacher 预测优化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Distill head within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Distill head\" data-node-name-en=\"Distill head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Distill head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">distillation token 对 teacher 预测优化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Distill head within the core distilled data efficient vit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"推理时通常平均 class 与 distillation head 预测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"双头融合\" data-node-name-en=\"fusion\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双头融合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">推理时通常平均 class 与 distillation head 预测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最终分类 logits/probabilities\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces fused class-token and distillation-token classification prediction via Class Logits Output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"类别输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Class Logits Output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_089_deit', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">类别输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Class Logits Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最终分类 logits/probabilities</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces fused class-token and distillation-token classification prediction via Class Logits Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DeiT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 类别 token 与蒸馏 token 的双头目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Joint Classification Token &amp; Hard-Label Teacher Distillation Token Objective</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DeiT：核心公式 · 类别 token 与蒸馏 token 的双头目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"89\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"20.288637pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -68.996029 247.561626 20.288637\" width=\"247.561626pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.o