<use x=\"81.378039\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-105\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"83.399857\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-115\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"86.119846\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-116\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"88.647022\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g4-186\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"92.462698\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g10-150\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"107.413244\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g10-63\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"112.793069\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-116\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"114.814888\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-101\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"118.043982\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-115\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"120.76397\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-116\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"126.058479\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g1-61\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"137.084834\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g10-63\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><use x=\"142.464659\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-99\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"145.693753\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-108\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"147.715571\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-115\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"153.256632\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g4-184\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><use x=\"162.534006\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g10-63\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><use x=\"167.913832\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-100\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"171.550197\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-105\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"173.572015\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-115\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"176.292003\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g14-116\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"42.461588\" x=\"136.357561\" y=\"-58.381092\"></rect><use x=\"155.097695\" xlink:href=\"#m089_g17-50\" y=\"-48.707392\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">原始 ViT 依赖超大私有数据，常规数据规模下训练不稳</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Original ViT required hundreds of millions of proprietary images (JFT-300M) and failed to generalize when trained on medium-sized datasets.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用强增强、正则化和蒸馏 token 在 ImageNet 上高效训练 ViT</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Combine aggressive data augmentation/regularization with a dedicated distillation token that learns from a convnet teacher.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把 CNN 教师知识通过 attention distillation 注入 Transformer</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Attention-based token distillation (distinct from logit averaging) + RandAugment, Mixup, CutMix, and Stochastic Depth recipe.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">降低医学 ViT 从头训练或小数据微调的门槛</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Lowered the barrier for training and fine-tuning Vision Transformers on moderate-sized medical imaging cohorts.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">训练 recipe 影响巨大；医学域仍需领域预训练与严格外部验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Established standard ViT training recipes; in-domain medical SSL pretraining still outperforms purely supervised recipes.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">数据效率主要来自强训练 recipe、正则和增强，并非只靠改变 ViT block。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">distillation token 在 self-attention 中与图像 patches 共同交互，学习 CNN teacher 的归纳偏置。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">teacher 只在训练中提供目标，部署时 DeiT 仍是纯 Transformer。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Combine aggressive data augmentation/regularization with a dedicated distillation token that learns from a convnet teacher.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Attention-based token distillation (distinct from logit averaging) + RandAugment, Mixup, CutMix, and Stochastic Depth recipe.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Joint Classification Token &amp; Hard-Label Teacher Distillation Token Objective.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可在有限医学标签下把 CNN teacher 的经验迁移到 ViT，并保留纯 token encoder 的扩展接口。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">ImageNet teacher 的纹理/类别偏置可能迁移到医学域；最好使用领域 teacher、领域预训练和外部验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Lowered the barrier for training and fine-tuning Vision Transformers on moderate-sized medical imaging cohorts.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Established standard ViT training recipes; in-domain medical SSL pretraining still outperforms purely supervised recipes.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v139/touvron21a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Training Data-Efficient Image Transformers &amp; Distillation through Attention</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/deit\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
